### Phase 0 evidence

- Repository identity on 2026-07-25:
  `D:\CODE\DFHack\DwarfSpec`, branch `cli-error-formatting`, with `origin`
  fetch and push set to `https://github.com/dsisco11/DwarfSpec.git`.
  Baseline `git status --short` was empty at `9e55ad4`.
- `.\tools\Run-UnitTests.ps1` reported 377 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors,
  and 0 pending on 2026-07-25.
- `.\tools\Check-Lua.ps1` passed Lua 5.4.6 syntax and formatting checks for
  224 files on 2026-07-25.
- `.\tools\Run-UnitTests.ps1 --filter 'DwarfSpec public mount commands'`
  reported 38 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors, and 0 pending.
- The current public declaration is the single overloaded `DS.mount` at
  `src/ds.d.lua:203-209`; its comments and overload describe the no-argument
  native attachment.
- The production dispatch is `src/dwarfspec/ds.lua:547-555`.
  `ds.mount()` sees zero arguments and calls `mount_native`; `ds.mount(nil)`
  sees one argument and enters component classification. The latter currently
  fails with `unsupported component input (nil)` and the supported DFHack
  component categories. `tests/unit/ds_mount_commands_spec.lua:400-457`
  directly locks both behaviors.
- Both `mount_context:mount` and `mount_context:mount_native` reject any
  already-current mount before allocation. Component-to-component is directly
  covered at `tests/unit/ds_mount_commands_spec.lua:380-398`; native-to-native
  and both cross-kind combinations currently reach the same assertion:
  `DwarfSpec mount rejected because mount <id> is still current; call
  ds.unmount() before mounting another component`. Repeated native attachment
  after explicit unmount is covered for five iterations at
  `tests/unit/ds_mount_commands_spec.lua:656-687`. Direct cross-kind coverage
  is intentionally added by Phase 3.
- Positive executable no-argument native calls are:
  `tests/unit/ds_mount_commands_spec.lua` at lines 402, 462, 496, 586, 629,
  659, 690, 723, 765, 786, 815, 864, 898, 942, 964, 972, 1020, 1039, 1057,
  1082, 1306, 1376, and 1490; and
  `tests/automation/native_screen_mount_live_spec.lua:198`.
- User-facing no-argument native references are
  `docs/architecture.md:90`,
  `docs/non-owning-native-screen-mount-proposal.md:5,9,98,102,249,575,630,665,696,720,761`,
  and `docs/writing-tests.md:209,233,300`.
  `docs/writing-tests.md:417` is also affected because it ambiguously says
  component specs use `ds.mount()` without showing a component argument.
  References in this checklist and `docs/project.todo` describe the planned
  removal and are not positive usage examples.
- The internal `mount_native` inventory is
  `src/dwarfspec/ds.lua:549`,
  `src/dwarfspec/mount_context.lua:756`, and
  `tests/unit/mount_context_spec.lua:760,829,867,903,949,985,1037,1080,1115,1153,1178`.
